---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service template for Che Xu Studio website use, packages, and payments."
  path="/terms"
  noindex={!siteConfig.allowIndexing}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-shell max-w-3xl">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Terms' }]} />
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-navy-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 rounded-md border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-950">
        <strong>Owner / legal review required before launch.</strong> This is a practical website template describing how packages and payments work in this application. It is not a substitute for legal counsel.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted sm:text-base">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Website use</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            By using this website, you agree not to misuse forms or the AI assistant (including attempts to probe secrets, overload endpoints, or submit abusive content).
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Packages and “starting at” pricing</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Package prices shown as “starting at” describe typical entry pricing in CAD. Final project fees depend on confirmed scope. Charges occur only after an agreed quote or written confirmation.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Payments</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            This website does not collect or store card numbers. Payment terms are confirmed in writing after a quote or plan request. Subscription plans renew monthly until cancelled according to the refund and cancellation policy.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">AI assistant</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The on-site assistant is an AI system, not a human. It may be unavailable at times and can make mistakes. Package details on the Pricing page and written quotes control over chat answers.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">SEO disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            SEO services improve foundations and opportunities for visibility. Specific search rankings, traffic volumes, or revenue outcomes are not guaranteed.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Governing details</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Governing law, limitation of liability, and dispute terms should be completed by an authorized owner or legal professional before launch.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
